<h1 data-start="676" data-end="714">2️⃣ Input Features Used by the Model</h1>
<p data-start="716" data-end="774">The model uses <strong data-start="731" data-end="755">features (variables)</strong> to learn patterns.</p>
<p data-start="776" data-end="811">Example features from your dataset:</p>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="813" data-end="1082" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="813" data-end="834"><tr data-start="813" data-end="834"><th data-start="813" data-end="823" data-col-size="sm" class="">Feature</th><th data-start="823" data-end="834" data-col-size="sm" class="">Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="851" data-end="1082"><tr data-start="851" data-end="875"><td data-start="851" data-end="860" data-col-size="sm">rating</td><td data-start="860" data-end="875" data-col-size="sm">Star rating</td></tr><tr data-start="876" data-end="924"><td data-start="876" data-end="892" data-col-size="sm">helpful_votes</td><td data-start="892" data-end="924" data-col-size="sm">How many people liked review</td></tr><tr data-start="925" data-end="961"><td data-start="925" data-end="941" data-col-size="sm">review_length</td><td data-start="941" data-end="961" data-col-size="sm">Length of review</td></tr><tr data-start="962" data-end="994"><td data-start="962" data-end="975" data-col-size="sm">word_count</td><td data-start="975" data-end="994" data-col-size="sm">Number of words</td></tr><tr data-start="995" data-end="1042"><td data-start="995" data-end="1013" data-col-size="sm">sentiment_score</td><td data-start="1013" data-end="1042" data-col-size="sm">Positive or negative tone</td></tr><tr data-start="1043" data-end="1082"><td data-start="1043" data-end="1057" data-col-size="sm">review_text</td><td data-start="1057" data-end="1082" data-col-size="sm">Actual review content</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.7969px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-w